<root>
  <!--
  Usage guide (keep this comment in both X.resx and X.es.resx).
    Key names: PascalCase, named by meaning and not by the text (StepStatusRunning, not Running).
    Values with placeholders end in "Format" (StatusMonitoringFormat = "Monitoring: {0}"); describe each
    placeholder in the <comment> of the entry. Never concatenate translated fragments: word order differs per language.
    Plurals: two keys, SummarySteps_One and SummarySteps_Other, picked with Plural.Pick(n, one, other).
    Adding a key: add the <data> entry to X.resx (English) AND to X.es.resx (Spanish) with the same name and the same
    placeholders; ResourceParityTest fails otherwise. The strongly typed class X is generated at build time.
    Adding a language: copy each X.resx to X.<code>.resx, translate the values and add the code to SupportedLanguages.
    UI text never lives as a literal in code.
  -->
